meta {
  name: patch user settings
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/user
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "logLevel": "debug"
  }
}

docs {
  Patch ~/.spectro/settings.json; answers the fresh process-moment view. 400 invalid patch, 500 I/O.
  
  Body: Flat JSON patch; a null-valued entry removes that key; logLevel applies live.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: yes
}
